WEBVTT

00:00:10.290 --> 00:00:13.080
Too bad about Tony.

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:17.410
If he hadn't fallen there,
he could've done better.

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:37.830
He's Japan's Samurai.

00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:39.830
He's amazing.

00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:41.580
Samurai?

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:46.370
Yeah, I heard he's going
to try a new triple move.

00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:48.450
A brand new move.

00:00:48.450 --> 00:00:52.830
If he succeeds, it'll be
named Aragaki after him.

00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:54.370
Aragaki...

00:01:06.410 --> 00:01:07.790
As expected of Aragaki.

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:09.540
He's really fired up--

00:01:09.540 --> 00:01:11.200
Just like a samurai!

00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:31.250
Aragaki! He did it!

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:55.830
If I can do even a little to help Joe...!

00:02:19.160 --> 00:02:27.910
"The Gymnastics Samurai"

00:03:39.450 --> 00:03:42.000
I still can't get a good landing.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:45.000
Your turns have gotten a lot smoother, though.

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:48.540
Now that you've gotten the hang of it,
you just need to drill it into your body.

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:49.830
How's your shoulder?

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:51.160
It's fine.

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:53.500
Make sure you keep getting
acupuncture treatments.

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:55.450
There's only another month before All-Japan.

00:03:55.450 --> 00:03:57.540
If you can perfect it in time,

00:03:57.540 --> 00:03:59.500
it'll be another big step toward Athens.

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:01.160
I'll make sure to do it.

00:04:02.580 --> 00:04:04.370
Joe, you can definitely do it!

00:04:04.370 --> 00:04:07.830
I'll also turn more than usual, indeed!

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:12.000
"Yotsuba Sports"

00:04:15.830 --> 00:04:18.410
You're really fired up.

00:04:18.410 --> 00:04:21.540
Well, I can't lose either.

00:04:21.540 --> 00:04:24.750
I mean, like, I'm seriously
betting on the next All-Japan.

00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:28.250
It's love. Pure love. A man's pure love.

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:30.000
Seriously. Really.

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:33.120
I'm gonna give it my all--

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:36.160
My heart of love! Rejected big time!

00:04:36.160 --> 00:04:39.040
Just fall in... big burn!

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:41.200
All right! One more set!

00:04:45.540 --> 00:04:45.790
"Owl in Ikebukuro!?"
"Viewer video"

00:04:45.790 --> 00:04:48.410
"Owl in Ikebukuro!?"
"Viewer video"

00:04:45.790 --> 00:04:48.410
Here in Ikebukuro, sightings of the white owl,
Fuku-chan have been reported...

00:04:48.410 --> 00:04:51.580
Here in Ikebukuro, sightings of the white owl,
Fuku-chan have been reported...

00:04:51.580 --> 00:04:54.080
"Ninja & Samurai"

00:04:51.580 --> 00:04:54.080
And then, he finally perfected it!

00:04:54.080 --> 00:04:57.700
"Ninja & Samurai"

00:04:54.080 --> 00:04:57.700
Joe's special Aragaki Mark II!

00:04:57.700 --> 00:04:58.910
Really?

00:04:58.910 --> 00:05:00.410
Good job, Dad!

00:05:00.410 --> 00:05:03.080
I still haven't landed it successfully,

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:05.160
so I can't say that I've perfected it yet.

00:05:05.160 --> 00:05:08.160
I'm sure you'll do it, Samurai!

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:10.660
Your rotations are perfect!

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:14.120
It's thanks to your support, Leo!

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:17.000
If it's for Joe's sake,

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:22.450
I am prepared to help with
my whole body and soul, indeed!

00:05:22.450 --> 00:05:25.040
What're you doin'?

00:05:25.040 --> 00:05:29.910
It's already been more than ten days
since Fuku-chan escaped.

00:05:29.910 --> 00:05:33.120
There have been repeated
sightings all over Toshima Ward,

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:37.370
so everyone's waiting to see
where Fuku-chan will show up next.

00:05:37.370 --> 00:05:38.870
Don't lose!

00:05:38.870 --> 00:05:40.830
Bigbird, you're too close to the TV!

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:48.450
Fuku-chan, come home!

00:06:40.870 --> 00:06:43.370
"Today's Fuku-chan"
"The owl, Fuku-chan, has been missing..."

00:06:48.040 --> 00:06:49.160
And then...

00:06:49.160 --> 00:06:51.580
Oh, do you remember Fuku-chan?

00:06:51.580 --> 00:06:53.580
The white owl we saw on TV.

00:06:53.580 --> 00:06:55.450
It was on the other day, right?

00:06:55.450 --> 00:06:57.410
Kazu said he saw it!

00:06:57.410 --> 00:07:01.160
But he said Fuku-chan flew away
before he could call the TV station.

00:07:01.160 --> 00:07:04.450
I wonder if Fuku-chan is scared
'cause everyone's chasing it.

00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:10.540
I hope Fuku-chan can go home soon.

00:07:27.450 --> 00:07:30.040
There's only one week left
until the competition.

00:07:30.040 --> 00:07:32.160
You cut it close, but you made it.

00:07:32.160 --> 00:07:35.410
Joe! You did it, indeed!

00:07:35.410 --> 00:07:39.750
I knew you could do it! I believed in you, Joe!

00:07:39.750 --> 00:07:42.910
Jotaro, the next few days will be crucial.

00:07:42.910 --> 00:07:47.000
We'll start thinking right away about how
to rework your routine to add the Mark II.

00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:48.330
Yes, sir!

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:58.910
The Samurai's unbeatable, indeed!

00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:01.580
I'm sure Rachel will be very happy, too!

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:05.500
Thanks, Leo.

00:08:11.330 --> 00:08:15.910
I just wanted to be of help to you, Joe.

00:08:17.410 --> 00:08:23.330
When I first met you, I was thinking
about retiring from gymnastics.

00:08:23.330 --> 00:08:25.450
But every time I tried to tell Rei,

00:08:25.450 --> 00:08:28.040
you'd get in the way,
and I wouldn't be able to tell her.

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:32.910
But then, after that,
you brought me to Britney's,

00:08:32.910 --> 00:08:36.200
and I finally understood what
Amakusa was talking about

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:40.910
and was able to face gymnastics once again.

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:42.950
That's what happened, huh?

00:08:42.950 --> 00:08:46.290
I'm really glad you didn't retire.

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:48.700
Yeah, me, too.

00:08:50.540 --> 00:08:54.580
I can picture you at All-Japan now!

00:08:54.580 --> 00:08:56.870
You do the Aragaki Mark II successfully,

00:08:56.870 --> 00:08:59.660
and everyone looks at you with admiring eyes...

00:08:59.660 --> 00:09:04.370
Watching your gymnastics is so thrilling,

00:09:04.370 --> 00:09:08.200
and I feel like it gives me courage, indeed.

00:09:08.200 --> 00:09:09.910
Leo.

00:09:09.910 --> 00:09:11.160
Hm?

00:09:11.160 --> 00:09:13.700
I want to help you, too.

00:09:13.700 --> 00:09:14.660
Huh?

00:09:14.660 --> 00:09:18.080
You like ballet, don't you?

00:09:18.080 --> 00:09:20.000
I've thought so this whole time.

00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:24.080
You lived your life before this

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:28.200
facing ballet seriously
with strong feelings, right?

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:31.830
If you decide to stop being a ninja
and return to the ballet world,

00:09:31.830 --> 00:09:33.660
I'll support you with everything I have.

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:38.580
Not just me. Everyone else, too.

00:09:38.580 --> 00:09:42.700
If you're injured, Britney
would help, and there's also--

00:09:42.700 --> 00:09:44.040
Huh?

00:09:44.040 --> 00:09:45.200
Hm?

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:50.750
Fuku-chan!

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:51.950
Joe?!

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:55.000
Is it really Fuku-chan?

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:58.950
A leg is caught in the fence.

00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:01.120
Wait for me! I'm coming to save you!

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:04.950
Joe, be careful!

00:10:10.160 --> 00:10:13.450
All right. Good birdie. Just stay still...

00:10:16.120 --> 00:10:17.290
Joe!

00:10:20.660 --> 00:10:24.370
You surprised me! Is Fuku-chan okay?

00:10:25.950 --> 00:10:29.830
It flew away fine, so probably, yeah.

00:10:29.830 --> 00:10:34.040
That's good, indeed! Jeez, I was so surprised!

00:10:35.410 --> 00:10:37.620
H-Huh?

00:10:37.620 --> 00:10:39.660
Hm? Joe?

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:43.160
Huh?

00:10:57.500 --> 00:11:00.330
Leo really loves ballet, huh?

00:11:00.330 --> 00:11:05.410
Watching that child dance makes me happy, too.

00:11:09.120 --> 00:11:11.200
To be that expressive at that age...

00:11:11.200 --> 00:11:13.200
He has extraordinary talent.

00:11:13.200 --> 00:11:15.660
He's a talent you only see
once every few decades.

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:17.950
He's a genius. There's no doubt about it!

00:11:17.950 --> 00:11:19.750
I'm looking forward to his future.

00:11:19.750 --> 00:11:23.290
I'm sure he'll be a
world-class principal dancer!

00:11:23.290 --> 00:11:25.200
The pride of Royal!

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:34.620
Today's performance wasn't very good.

00:11:34.620 --> 00:11:37.750
He didn't seem that different
from a regular scholarship student.

00:11:41.580 --> 00:11:44.330
It's because he's special.

00:11:44.330 --> 00:11:48.080
This should be easy for you, right?
Since you're a genius.

00:11:48.080 --> 00:11:49.910
You should be able to do it.

00:11:49.910 --> 00:11:51.870
There's no way you can't do it.

00:11:51.870 --> 00:11:55.000
Please don't disappoint me.

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:59.250
That's it! That's worthy of being
called the "pride of Royal"!

00:12:03.870 --> 00:12:06.500
He's different from us.

00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:09.410
There's no way he can understand how we feel.

00:12:09.410 --> 00:12:11.450
Mr. Genius is lucky...

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:19.330
Don't worry about it. You're a genius.

00:12:19.330 --> 00:12:21.200
Show me more emotion!

00:12:21.200 --> 00:12:23.250
More! More!

00:12:23.250 --> 00:12:25.450
Yes, that's it!

00:12:25.450 --> 00:12:28.370
You can do it! Because you're a genius!

00:12:28.370 --> 00:12:32.580
That's it! That's worthy
of being the "pride of Royal"!

00:12:59.120 --> 00:13:04.410
"Nin"
"The fight of the woman hidden
in the annals of history"

00:13:04.410 --> 00:13:08.910
"Path of the Ninja"
"History of Ninjas in the Warring States"
"Ninja Training Manual"

00:13:19.330 --> 00:13:20.750
Ninja...

00:13:22.120 --> 00:13:24.620
I want...

00:13:24.620 --> 00:13:26.450
...to hide, too...

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:31.120
"Kawamoto Orthopedic Clinic"
"Acupuncture and Moxibustion"

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:33.870
I can't believe this was because of Fuku-chan...

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:35.580
Sorry...

00:13:37.950 --> 00:13:39.450
It's a sprain.

00:13:39.450 --> 00:13:41.200
Your bones seem fine.

00:13:41.200 --> 00:13:43.370
It doesn't look like you
hurt anything else, either.

00:13:43.370 --> 00:13:45.080
Your shoulder is the same as usual, too.

00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:47.450
Amakusa, what about the treatment?

00:13:47.450 --> 00:13:49.750
I've already contacted the clinic.

00:13:49.750 --> 00:13:52.410
We'll go over now to get some
painkillers injected into you.

00:13:52.410 --> 00:13:55.120
We need to adjust your training plan, too.

00:13:55.120 --> 00:13:57.910
I'm sorry to cause trouble
right before the competition...

00:13:57.910 --> 00:14:00.040
We can't do anything about
what's already happened.

00:14:00.040 --> 00:14:02.040
At least you didn't break anything.

00:14:02.040 --> 00:14:06.580
W-Wait! Don't tell me you're
still planning on competing?

00:14:06.580 --> 00:14:08.500
You've got a sprain, you know.

00:14:08.500 --> 00:14:12.000
Yeah, this isn't so bad.

00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:14.160
It's completely different from this.

00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:18.410
That became a chronic injury and really
put your future as a gymnast in jeopardy.

00:14:18.410 --> 00:14:19.660
But--!

00:14:19.660 --> 00:14:24.040
Even if it's not that bad now, if you
force yourself and make it worse...!

00:14:24.040 --> 00:14:27.450
It's true that competing
like that isn't without risk.

00:14:27.450 --> 00:14:30.790
Even if you can get through it this
time with painkillers and taping,

00:14:30.790 --> 00:14:33.620
if you end up injuring it again,

00:14:33.620 --> 00:14:37.250
then it might affect you in the future.

00:14:37.250 --> 00:14:39.250
I don't think you should compete after all, Joe!

00:14:39.250 --> 00:14:40.910
Calm down.

00:14:40.910 --> 00:14:45.200
In the first place, top-class athletes are usually
dealing with some kind of injury or another.

00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:47.250
They just have to deal with it.

00:14:48.660 --> 00:14:51.450
Well, Fuku-chan was unexpected, though.

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:52.910
I'm sorry.

00:14:52.910 --> 00:14:55.540
But--But what if Joe really--

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:57.410
Don't worry.

00:14:57.410 --> 00:15:02.330
I will definitely successfully land
the Mark II that I perfected with you.

00:15:10.580 --> 00:15:12.080
Welcome back.

00:15:12.080 --> 00:15:13.660
Good work today.

00:15:13.660 --> 00:15:15.040
I messed up.

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:17.910
You really never change, huh, Dad?

00:15:17.910 --> 00:15:21.250
I chose dishes from Mom's recipes
that are supposed to help with injuries.

00:15:23.540 --> 00:15:25.950
Thanks. I appreciate it.

00:15:25.950 --> 00:15:28.040
Are you going to the hospital first tomorrow?

00:15:28.040 --> 00:15:30.750
I already had Britney do some adjustments,

00:15:30.750 --> 00:15:32.620
so the pain is mostly gone.

00:15:32.620 --> 00:15:34.410
Then you'll just go straight to the club?

00:15:34.410 --> 00:15:36.410
Get better soon!

00:15:52.700 --> 00:15:57.450
Samurai over there, can you hear my voice?

00:15:57.450 --> 00:16:02.500
You are injured. You should not
push yourself right now.

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:05.330
Give up on the tournament and rest.

00:16:05.330 --> 00:16:07.660
This is a message from God, indeed.

00:16:07.660 --> 00:16:10.450
Do you understand, Samurai? Give up on--

00:16:21.120 --> 00:16:23.700
Leo, I'm going to compete.

00:16:32.830 --> 00:16:35.370
Why?

00:16:35.370 --> 00:16:39.500
There are so many more tournaments
you could compete in in the future.

00:16:41.250 --> 00:16:46.330
I don't want to see you fail and become useless.

00:16:49.290 --> 00:16:51.910
I might fail.

00:16:51.910 --> 00:16:54.910
But I won't become useless.

00:16:54.910 --> 00:16:58.620
Before, I didn't understand anything.

00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:02.580
I thought that if I just practiced
as much as I could, I would get stronger.

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:05.450
I didn't look at my surroundings.
I just pushed forward on my own,

00:17:05.450 --> 00:17:10.250
and before I knew it,
I was being forced to retire.

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:12.290
But then, I realized.

00:17:17.250 --> 00:17:19.040
I'm not alone.

00:17:19.040 --> 00:17:21.910
With everyone's support and help,

00:17:21.910 --> 00:17:24.950
I've been able to keep doing gymnastics.

00:17:24.950 --> 00:17:27.370
I want to respond to those feelings.

00:17:27.370 --> 00:17:29.120
I'll do everything I can.

00:17:29.120 --> 00:17:31.700
I'll overcome any hurdle.

00:17:31.700 --> 00:17:37.120
Because beyond them are the smiles
of everyone who supported me.

00:17:37.120 --> 00:17:39.620
I won't back down again.

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:43.790
That's my gymnastics.

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:50.120
Leo, what are you afraid of?

00:17:53.200 --> 00:17:57.660
I don't know why you came
to Japan and became a ninja,

00:17:57.660 --> 00:18:01.540
but I can tell that you are amazingly talented.

00:18:01.540 --> 00:18:05.910
And I can tell that you practiced
and worked really hard, too.

00:18:05.910 --> 00:18:08.290
I've decided to do it.

00:18:08.290 --> 00:18:10.750
What about you, Leo?

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:16.830
Even though you can do it, why won't you?

00:18:16.830 --> 00:18:19.790
If it's you, I'm sure you can do it.

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:25.950
I can't do it...

00:18:25.950 --> 00:18:30.500
I can't... become strong...

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:32.370
...like you, Joe...

00:18:45.330 --> 00:18:46.250
Jotaro!

00:18:46.250 --> 00:18:47.290
Hm?

00:18:49.160 --> 00:18:51.290
A traffic accident?

00:18:51.290 --> 00:18:53.700
Her condition seems very precarious.

00:18:53.700 --> 00:18:56.330
For the competition, I'll figure
something out with the other five.

00:18:56.330 --> 00:19:00.910
You should get ready to go
back to Japan. I'll have...

00:19:01.910 --> 00:19:04.290
I'll compete.

00:19:04.290 --> 00:19:07.330
What?! Hey, Jotaro?

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:08.870
Jotaro!

00:19:25.750 --> 00:19:27.830
Tomoyo...

00:19:27.830 --> 00:19:29.200
I...

00:19:33.950 --> 00:19:35.000
A second time?!

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:43.330
Sometimes things are hard,

00:19:43.330 --> 00:19:45.700
or they don't go how I want.

00:19:45.700 --> 00:19:48.370
But I just have to do it, right?

00:19:48.370 --> 00:19:51.750
I mean, it's something I love doing.

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:54.250
Nothing else matters.

00:19:56.450 --> 00:19:59.370
I just... have to do it...

00:19:59.370 --> 00:20:01.660
I just have to do it...

00:20:01.660 --> 00:20:03.660
You should just smile!

00:20:09.410 --> 00:20:13.750
Dad! I'll work hard even if Mom's not around!

00:20:13.750 --> 00:20:16.200
So do your best at gymnastics!

00:20:16.200 --> 00:20:19.870
Because I love your gymnastics!

00:20:23.330 --> 00:20:25.750
But I just have to do it, right?

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:28.870
I mean, it's something I love doing.

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:31.500
Nothing else matters.

00:22:24.000 --> 00:22:26.000
"Fuku-chan
returns to owner..."

00:22:26.500 --> 00:22:28.290
Good work.

00:22:29.290 --> 00:22:32.620
Hey, do you know where Leo is?

00:22:32.620 --> 00:22:35.120
Did he go off somewhere again?

00:22:35.120 --> 00:22:37.120
--Rei.
--Hm?

00:22:37.120 --> 00:22:38.870
I want to talk to you about something.

00:22:38.870 --> 00:22:39.950
Hm?

00:22:40.950 --> 00:22:42.750
Leo did...?

00:22:42.750 --> 00:22:48.870
Yeah, so I'll definitely land the
Aragaki Mark II successfully and win.

00:22:49.950 --> 00:22:56.250
I'll believe in him and do the best
gymnastics I can right now until the end.

00:22:56.250 --> 00:22:58.370
I'll believe in Leo, too.
